DESCRIPTION:<p><b>Member organizers</b> are members from the rank and file
  who connect with workers from around the country to share experiences\, d
 evelop skills\, and organize to build power within the labor movement.</p>
 The <b>purpose</b> of the member organizer program is to strengthen our un
 ion by developing our members to do the work of our union.<br><br>Come joi
 n our Biannual meeting to meet members from around the country\, connect\,
  and brainstorm through organizing topics together.
