DESCRIPTION:Participants must be based in sub-Saharan Africa.\nA new round
  of the SJN’s Train-the-Trainers program is open now. For this round we 
 are seeking applicants from the sub-Saharan region of Africa.\nFor those a
 ccepted\, you’ll get extensive solutions journalism training over the co
 urse of five sessions in June. That training will deeply cover the fundame
 ntals of solutions journalism before exploring best practices in teaching 
 and training others in it.\nThe hosts for this round will be Caroline Karo
 bia\, SJN’s Africa Initiative manager\; Nina Fasciaux\, SJN’s director
  of partnerships and fellowship\; and Chibuike Alagboso from Nigeria Healt
 h Watch. The deadline to apply is May 15\, so get all the details\, timing
 \, requirements and the full applicationall in one place.
